<title>KUWAIT: TABLE-Kuwait Commercial Bank H1 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kuwait Commercial Bank H1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>			  (Million of dinars unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1997			 1996</p>
<p> Profit			  12.51			 9.07</p>
<p> Interest income	     37.53			 33.42</p>
<p> Net interest income	 11.77			 7.81</p>
<p> Provisions		     1.01			  --</p>
<p> Loan and advances	  374,54			216,14</p>
<p> Government debt bonds    441.68			513.36</p>
<p> Total sssets		1,221			 1,110</p>
<p>Full name: The Commercial Bank of Kuwait SAK.</p>
<p>Note - The bank said in a results statement published in paid advertisements in local newspapers that &quot;a number of new intiatives&quot; were adopted to ensure that growth in the second half of 1997 would be maintained.</p>
<p>- Ashraf Fouad, +965 240 8945</p>
